WEBVTT

00:33:58.371 --> 00:34:00.829
Why does it get people in trouble
if they get it earlier?

00:34:01.496 --> 00:34:06.329
Oh, you know, there are a variety of ways
that this can happen in the first place.

00:34:06.329 --> 00:34:08.579
It's very destructive. I mean,

00:34:08.829 --> 00:34:14.038
people start taking you more seriously
than they did and hanging

00:34:14.038 --> 00:34:17.413
on your every word and a lot
of nonsense like this.

00:34:18.413 --> 00:34:22.371
And if if you begin to take
yourself too seriously,

00:34:23.538 --> 00:34:28.913
that's not good if you take
time away from your work.